WEBVTT

00:15:59.083 --> 00:16:02.268
Another Troy, an Irish Troy.

00:16:02.292 --> 00:16:04.976
Closer to the sinking sun.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.851
Unconquered.

00:16:06.875 --> 00:16:10.101
If you could hear this song,

00:16:10.125 --> 00:16:13.226
you, too, would listen in rapture

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.434
to the mná caointe

00:16:15.458 --> 00:16:17.768
keening women, crying out,

00:16:17.792 --> 00:16:19.768
grieving, heart-struck

00:16:19.792 --> 00:16:23.059
in eternal chorus at the wake,

00:16:23.083 --> 00:16:27.893
where the last best hope
of humanity beats on.

00:16:27.917 --> 00:16:31.268
That mortal being incarnate in flesh